    "text": "Her saga\u00fe an \u00feisan drihtnes \u00e6rendgewrite, \u00fe\u00e6t fyr cyme\u00fe on suman h\u00e6rfeste.\nAnd hit gefealla\u00fe \u00e6rest on Scotta land and sy\u00fe\u00fean on Angelcing and de\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6r \u00e6lc yfel.\nAnd \u00feonne f\u00e6r\u00fe hit su\u00fe ofer s\u00e6 on \u00fea \u00feeodland and forb\u00e6rn\u00fe \u00e6g\u00feer ge mancynne man and eac micelne\nAn diacan w\u00e6s dead nu an unmenigum geare, \u00fe\u00e6s nama w\u00e6s Nial.\nHe w\u00e6s an Scotta ealonde, and he w\u00e6s v wucan dead; and he \u00fea eft of dea\u00fee aras \u00feurh Cristes mihte and\nAnd nes si\u00fe\u00fean, \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00e6nige eor\u00felices metes anbergde, ne nefre si\u00fe\u00fean he butan cirican ne com.\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6s diacones naman w\u00e6s haten Nial.\nAnd se diacan s\u00e6gde be \u00feam fyre, ealswa we reda\u00fe an sunnandeges spelle, \u00fe\u00e6t drihten self awrat, \u00fe\u00e6t\nAnd \u00feonne s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fees diacon, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t fyr come for\u00fean ofer manna bearn, for\u00fean hie gelefdon to\nAc him wi\u00fesaca\u00fe menige men and nella\u00fe gelefan an \u00feas halgan lare.\nFor\u00feon hiom s\u00e6nd god on micelne brogan, fyr and hungor, butan hio to godes geleafan \u00e6r gecyrran\n\u00deus bodade No\u00eb se witega \u00feone micel flod menniscum cynne huru hundteontigum wintrum, \u00e6r he\nAnd \u00feonne Noe \u00feis mannum s\u00e6de be \u00feam flode, swa \u00fees diacon dyde nu be \u00feysum fyre drehtnes selfes\nAnd hit agan \u00fea rinan xl daga and xl nihta tosomne \u00fe\u00e6m m\u00e6stan rene, and sio eor\u00fee rinde ealswa swi\u00fee\nSe flod w\u00e6s bufan \u00feam hegestan munde, \u00fee is an middangearde.\nAnd \u00fea adruncan ealle cwice wihte, \u00fee betwioh heofonum and eor\u00fean w\u00e6ran butan viii mannum: \u00fe\u00e6t\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t is lang and wundarlic to asecgenne, hu \u00fea wurdan generede in \u00feare Noes earce, \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r to lafe\nSwa \u00feonne nu gegonge\u00fe \u00feam mannum, \u00fee \u00feyses fyres cymes geleafan nella\u00fe, \u00fe\u00e6t hio ealle forwyr\u00fea\u00fe.\nHwet, drehten hine selfne to \u00fean geeadmette, \u00fe\u00e6t he awrat gewrit an \u00fe\u00e6m seofe\u00fean heofone swi\u00fee\nFor\u00fean se sunnandeg wes gehalgod eallum mannum to reste butan deoflum anum and h\u00e6\u00feenum\nAnd \u00feis gewrit he awrat mid geldenum stafum and hit \u00fea ans\u00e6nde to mankynne, for\u00feon \u00fee hie h\u00e6fdan\nAnd an \u00feane d\u00e6g w\u00e6s Adam gescapen, se \u00e6rysta man.\nAnd an \u00feone d\u00e6g Moyses oferferde \u00fea readan s\u00e6 mid his weorude, and his feond adruncan be\u00e6ftan him\nAnd an \u00feane d\u00e6g drehten angan erest fedan Israela folc in \u00feam westenne mid manan, \u00feam heofenlican\nAnd swi\u00fee oft drehten bead \u00feam halgan Moyse, \u00fe\u00e6t he bude manna bearnum, \u00fe\u00e6t hio an \u00feane d\u00e6g ne\nAnd drehten w\u00e6s sume si\u00fee \u00feus sprecende to Moyse and cw\u00e6\u00fe: sprec to Israhela bearnum and cwe\u00fe to\nAnd on \u00feam d\u00e6ge he awende w\u00e6ter to wine.\nAnd so\u00felice swa hwilc iowar, swa hine besmite\u00fe mid \u00e6nigre yfelnysse an \u00feone halgan sunnand\u00e6g,\nAnd swa hwylc man, swa his weorc de\u00fe an \u00feane halgan sunnandeg, \u00feanne weor\u00fea\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6s mannes lif and\nHwylcne dea\u00fe mende he drehten swi\u00feor, \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6s mannes sawle scolde bion cw\u00e6lmed in \u00fe\u00e6m\nAnd drehten eft cw\u00e6\u00fe: vi dagas sindon, \u00fe\u00e6t iow is alefed, \u00fe\u00e6t ge motan iower weorc an wyrcan.\nAnd se seofo\u00fea ys drehtnes se halga rested\u00e6g.\nAnd ealle, \u00fea \u00fee do\u00fe heora w\u00e6orc an \u00feam d\u00e6ge, \u00feanne bio\u00fe \u00fea dea\u00fees sceldige: se dea\u00fe bi\u00fe \u00feonne in\nAc healda\u00fe, Israela bearn, \u00feone minne halgan rysted\u00e6g and m\u00e6rsia\u00fe hine in iowrum ciricum, for\u00feon\nAnd so\u00felice on six dagum w\u00e6ran geworhte heofan and eor\u00fee and ealle \u00fea gesc\u00e6fta, \u00fee in hiom sindan;\n\u00dea weran an \u00feare \u00feiode iii ealdormen on Israhela folce, and \u00fea noldan drehtnes beboda healdan, ac\nDathon hatte an and Abiron and Choreb, and hi noldan weor\u00feian \u00feone haligan sunnand\u00e6g, swa heom\n\u00dea forwurdon hi sona, and sio ior\u00fee tob\u00e6rst undernio\u00fean heom, and hio fillon \u00fea \u00feurh \u00fea eor\u00fean mid\nSwa \u00feonne nu gegange\u00fe manna bearnum, \u00fe\u00e6t heora sawle bio\u00fe ascyrede in helle diopnesse, gef hio\nHiom weor\u00fe swa, swa swa \u00feare bocere sawle bi\u00fe, \u00fee nella\u00fe godspel s\u00e6cgan godes folce for hiora\nFor\u00feon \u00fee Crist selfa cw\u00e6\u00fe: \u00feeah mann anum men godspyl secge, \u00feonne bio ic an hiora midle; and\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t is cu\u00fe eac, \u00fe\u00e6t Iordane is seo ea, for\u00fean Crist w\u00e6s in hire gefulwad in sunnand\u00e6ge, hio\nDrehten cw\u00e6\u00fe, \u00fe\u00e6t he come to demenne cwicum and deadum an \u00feone halgan sunnand\u00e6g; \u00fea he\nAnd drihten ansende an sunnandege his apostolum \u00feone halgan gast in fyre ansyne.\nAnd an \u00feam dege wurdan tod\u00e6lde ealra manna gehriorde; and \u00e6r w\u00e6s eal weoruld sprecende an an\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t is eac cu\u00fe, \u00fe\u00e6t for \u00fe\u00e6s d\u00e6ges halgunge and weor\u00feunge \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea sauwla onfo\u00fe reste, \u00fea \u00fea\nAnd we gelyfa\u00fe \u00feurh godes gife, \u00fe\u00e6t hit swa sig, gif hi Criste her on life on \u00e6nigan \u00feingan\nAc \u00fea, \u00fea to helle becuma\u00fe, ne cuma\u00fe hit n\u00e6fre to reste, ah \u00fear acwylmia\u00fe mid saule on \u00feam lichaman\nAnd hit is to lang eal to awritenne, hu oft se an d\u00e6g wes gehalgod, and hu oft he w\u00e6s forboden \u00feurh\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t gelamp on Moyses dagum, \u00fe\u00e6t Moyses for \u00feurh anne wudu mid his werode; \u00fea gesawan hie\n\u00dea het Moyses, \u00fe\u00e6t hine mon gebunde, and \u00fe\u00e6t hine mon dede in carcern, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he askede \u00feone\n\u00dea freni Moyses urne drihten, hu he \u00feane ceorl ation scolde, \u00fee him wudade an \u00fean halgan sunnand\u00e6g.\n\u00dea het ure drehten, \u00fe\u00e6t hine me dede of life.\nHw\u00e6t, \u00fea wes openlice getanad, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00fe senleas wite, \u00fe\u00e6t mon an \u00feam genim\u00fe, \u00fee he unalefedlice\nAnd Nial sede, se diacon, se wes v wucan an heofonum, \u00fe\u00e6t god sige sunnandeges weorcum and\nAnd hit hef\u00fe nu ofergan eal cristen folc, \u00fe\u00e6t hio sindon to gemerlease Cristes selfes beboda and him to\nAc hiom \u00fe\u00e6s cym\u00fe ful \u00e6r ece hunger, \u00feam \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6s fyres frecynysse ged\u00e6ge\u00fe and \u00fe\u00e6t ofercuma\u00fe.\nAnd drehten sende his agen handgewrit an Sancte Petres heahaltare in his cirican, \u00fe\u00e6r m\u00e6st manna to\nAnd he \u00fe\u00e6t dyde, for\u00feon \u00fee he wolde \u00fea get his mildheortnesse an mannum gecy\u00fean and us gecy\u00fean,\nAnd \u00fea w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t gewrit \u00feus gewriten mid geldenum stafum: amen, amen, dico uobis, quod misit\n\u00dea sende ic gershoppan anufan iowerne hw\u00e6te, and ge \u00fea get gecyrran noldan, \u00fe\u00e6t ge wel gehealdan\nSo\u00fe, so\u00fe is, \u00fe\u00e6t ic iow s\u00e6cge, \u00fe\u00e6t ic s\u00e6nde an iow birnenda renas and sweflen l\u00e6g of heofonum, and\nEala hw\u00e6t, monnum iu stranglice gelamp for sunnand\u00e6ges weorce, \u00fe\u00e6t he drihten sende ceferas ofer\nAnd \u00fea hy drehten anget, \u00fe\u00e6t men \u00fea get noldan geswican untidweorca, he \u00fea s\u00e6nde wunderlice\n\u00dea andged he ure drihten, \u00fe\u00e6t men noldan \u00fea get healdan sunnandeges bebod, he sende \u00fea birnende\n\u00deis w\u00e6s geworden on Egipta lande.\nHie \u00fea heoldan letle wile sunnandeges bebod and brecan eft and noldan geswican untidweorces, \u00fea\n\u00dea gelamp hit binnan feawe gerum, \u00fe\u00e6t menn eft oferhogodan sunnand\u00e6ges bebod and s\u00e6ternes ofer\n\u00dea angan drehten selfa dihtan \u00fe\u00e6t gewrit, \u00fee her nu for\u00fe s\u00e6ge\u00fe, and he cw\u00e6\u00fe: so\u00fe is, \u00fe\u00e6t ic iow secge,\nSo\u00fe is, \u00fe\u00e6t ic eow s\u00e6cge, \u00fe\u00e6t ic w\u00e6s ge\u00feyldig for iow, and ge me oft tynan gededan, \u00feanne \u00feearfan\nSo\u00fe, so\u00fe is, \u00fe\u00e6t ic iow s\u00e6cge, gef ge ne healda\u00fe \u00feane halgan sunnand\u00e6g fram nontide \u00fe\u00e6s\nIc eom godes sunu, and ic feola ge\u00ferowade for iow, ic w\u00e6s an rode ahangen for iow, and ic dea\u00fe\n\u00dea he \u00feanne mende \u00feane egeslican domes deg.\nHw\u00e6t, he drihten \u00fea openlice cydde on \u00feam worde, \u00fea he cw\u00e6\u00fe, \u00fe\u00e6t an sunnand\u00e6g of dea\u00fee arise,\nCrist selfa and ealle halgan hefdan for sunnandeg \u00feone d\u00e6g, \u00fee Crist aras of dea\u00fee.\nAnd from nontide \u00fe\u00e6s s\u00e6ternesd\u00e6ges o\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6s monand\u00e6ges lihtincge ge sceolan heoldan, and gef hit\nAnd drehten w\u00e6s \u00fea get for\u00fe sprecende, and he cw\u00e6\u00fe: so\u00fe, so\u00fe is, \u00fe\u00e6t ic iow s\u00e6cge, se \u00fee ne\nEalle fy\u00feerfete nytenu cleopia\u00fe to me, and ic hio geh\u00e6re, and hiom nilla\u00fe reste forgefan an \u00feone\nSo\u00fe is iow s\u00e6cge, gef ge ne healda\u00fe \u00feone halgan sunnandeg mid rihte, \u00fe\u00e6t ic s\u00e6nde gyt ofer iow\nSo\u00fe ys, \u00fe\u00e6t ic iow s\u00e6cge, gef ge healda\u00fe \u00feone halgan sunnandeg mid rihte, mid \u00e6lmessan and mid\nAnd ic blissige an iow and ge on me; and ge bio\u00fe halige, for\u00feon ic eam eowar drihten, and nis \u00e6nig\nSo\u00fe is, \u00fe\u00e6t ic iow s\u00e6cge, \u00fe\u00e6t ic swerige \u00feurh minne miht and \u00feurh mine \u00fea halgan \u00e6nglas, cherubin\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00fe ure drihten: \u00feurh hiora mihte ic swerige, gef ge ne healda\u00fe \u00feane haligan sunnandeg mid\nAnd ic \u00feanne wille forb\u00e6rnan ealle eower god and ealle, \u00fea \u00fee an unrihtum tidum yfel wyrca\u00fe, o\u00fe\u00fee\nOnd eghwilcan men is beboden \u00feurh god selfne in Cristes noman and in \u00fear\u00e6 halgan \u00ferinnesse naman\nAnd gef he \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t agemelease\u00fe, \u00fe\u00e6t he l\u00e6ta\u00fe licgan \u00feis godspyl unnet godes folce, \u00fe\u00e6t hit ne nan\nAnd \u00feis bio\u00fe \u00fea mon\u00feas september and october, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feys fyr an becym\u00fe, \u00fee se diacon \u00e6r bi segde, \u00fe\u00e6t\nFlorentius se papa and Petrus se bescup w\u00e6ron on \u00fea tid on Rome, \u00fea \u00feis gewrit becom anufan Sancte\nSo\u00felice hie \u00fe\u00e6s w\u00e6ran gewitan, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feis halige gewrit of heofonum com, and hio hit fundan anufan\nAnd hie \u00fea for\u00fean \u00feus cw\u00e6dan and miclum cy\u00fedan: wit sweriga\u00fe \u00feurh \u00feane micelan anwald ures\nMen \u00fea leofestan, hwilc man is \u00feonne efre, butan his heorte se eal mid deofles strealum awrecan, \u00fe\u00e6t\nAnd hit gelamp an \u00fea tid, \u00fee \u00feis gewrit becom anufan Sancte Petres wefode, \u00fe\u00e6t se stod wear\u00fe eal\nAnd gef eor\u00felice men nu agemeleasia\u00fe \u00feis\u00e6s gewrites bebodes, \u00feonne ne ge\u00fe\u00e6nca\u00fe hio na, hu strang\n\u00deonne mana\u00fe us \u00feis halige gewrit, \u00fe\u00e6t we simle sion geynegode to ure saule \u00feearfe and \u00fe\u00e6s ytmestan\nAnd \u00feonne we sculon \u00e6lces unnyttes riht ageldan an \u00feene bifigendan domes dege for eallum \u00feam\nAnd eac we sculan \u00fe\u00e6r riht ageldan for ures lifes dede, \u00fee we si\u00fe o\u00fe\u00fee \u00e6r efre gefremedan fram ures\nNe megan wy \u00feanne ure misdeda behedan ne bedigligan, ac hio bio\u00fe \u00feanne ealle opene and unwrigene\nAnd us mon \u00feanne nenigre deda grimlicor ne menga\u00fe, \u00